# Power Leak: "Enchant enchantment. At the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted enchantment's controller, that player may pay any
# amount of mana. This Aura deals 2 damage to that player. Prevent X of that damage, where X is the amount of mana that player paid
# this way." Bot1 casts it on Bot2's Flood (not on Bot2's Memnite: enchant enchantment, CR 303.4a). On turn 4, Bot2's upkeep, Bot2 -
# the enchanted enchantment's controller, not the Aura's - pays one mana (Mox Sapphire) and is dealt 1 of the 2 damage. On turn 6
# Bot2 declines and is dealt all 2 (CR 608.2d, 608.2c, 615.7). Bot1, the Aura's controller, is dealt nothing.

